{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/597","tmdb_id":597,"title":"泰坦尼克号","original_title":"Titanic","overview":"1912年4月10日，号称 “世界工业史上的奇迹”的豪华客轮泰坦尼克号开始了它完工后的首次商业航行，从英国的南安普顿出发驶往美国纽约。富家少女罗丝与母亲及未婚夫卡尔坐上了头等舱；另一边，放荡不羁的少年画家杰克也在码头的一场赌博中赢得了下等舱的船票。罗丝厌倦了上流社会虚伪的生活，不愿嫁给卡尔，打算投海自尽，被杰克救起。很快，美丽活泼的罗丝与英俊开朗的杰克相爱，杰克带罗丝参加下等舱的舞会、为她画像，二人的感情逐渐升温。1912年4月14日，星期天晚上，一个风平浪静的夜晚。泰坦尼克号撞上了冰山，“永不沉没的”泰坦尼克号面临沉船的命运，罗丝和杰克刚萌芽的爱情也将经历生死的考验。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFYUkUPcFXDzZzSfkiCDsvHIJxj.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnHVX37XZEp33hhCbYlQFq7ux1J.jpg","release_date":"1997-12-18","year":"1997","runtime":"194 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":7.903,"tmdb_votes":27146,"tmdb_rating":"7.903 / 10 from 27146 users","genres":["剧情","爱情"],"languages":["English","French","German","Swedish","Italian","Russian"],"countries":["United States of America"],"production_companies":["Paramount Pictures","20th Century Fox","Lightstorm Entertainment"],"directors":[{"name":"詹姆斯·卡梅隆","id":2710}],"producers":[{"name":"Jon Landau","id":8529},{"name":"詹姆斯·卡梅隆","id":2710}],"cast":[{"id":6193,"name":"莱昂纳多·迪卡普里奥","original_name":"Leonardo DiCaprio","character":"Jack Dawson","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/mkdRcVIQl4WZhDf1vXKWTD7HZrZ.jpg"},{"id":204,"name":"凯特·温斯莱特","original_name":"Kate Winslet","character":"Rose DeWitt Bukater","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/6qNnMsKtKz9si5rabpUEG85UfHp.jpg"},{"id":1954,"name":"比利·赞恩","original_name":"Billy Zane","character":"Cal Hockley","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/wr4fuwLzQvW1G0MS7cmQ3ObFjvL.jpg"},{"id":8534,"name":"凯西·贝茨","original_name":"Kathy Bates","character":"Molly Brown","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/qZRTzTjV4OC1Ii9a0n8QBS9zMOd.jpg"},{"id":3713,"name":"弗兰西丝·费舍","original_name":"Frances Fisher","character":"Ruth DeWitt Bukater","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/3iNDgd54IIj8g8hGqhhUjM6TeWd.jpg"},{"id